<title>USA: Environmental Tech to buy Thermaflo.</title>
<headline>Environmental Tech to buy Thermaflo.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Technologies Corp said it would buy American Thermaflo Corp, a private Springfield, Mass.-based maker of portable refrigerant recovery and recycling equipment.</p>
<p>Environmental Tech said in a statement released Friday that it and Thermaflo had signed a letter of intent for the purchase. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
